"//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc12g0d.jpg"}], "slug": "a-short-quest", "storyline": "A Short Quest is a first-person RPG developed by a 2 man indie team. Together we are building a lovingly crafted RPG set within the borders of a crumbling Kingdom. The king has gone mad, goblin raids have become commonplace and you are tasked with a seemingly simple task. Take a note of great importance to the king, and survive the journey.", "summary": "Explore a hand-crafted world, overcome brutally challenging combat, and restore order to a broken kingdom. Discover unique weapons, tools, spells, and secrets in this short game inspired by old school action RPGs.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/a-short-quest", "videos": [{"id": 177472, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "l43D4qaGhF0", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=l43D4qaGhF0", "title": "A Short Quest - Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/l43D4qaGhF0/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 180996, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "5oqpJPsYlvE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5oqpJPsYlvE", "title": "A Short Quest - Combat Demo Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/5oqpJPsYlvE/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 194065, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "nkYyrLVl3qY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nkYyrLVl3qY", "title": "A Short Quest | King's Wood Playtest Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/nkYyrLVl3qY/fhddefault.jpg"}, {"id": 195204, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "8hxZRg9zNUw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8hxZRg9zNUw", "title": "A Short Quest | Best Indie Games Fall Showcase 2026", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/8hxZRg9zNUw/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}